# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development. `.dev.vars` is gitignored.

# Required. HMAC key used to sign bid mandates. Any non-empty string works
# locally; use a strong random value in production via:
#   wrangler secret put MANDATE_SECRET
MANDATE_SECRET=local-development-secret-change-me

# Optional. Without it, bidder agents fall back to their deterministic policy
# and the auction still runs — it simply runs without model-driven bidding.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
